OL,3,GNEWSA'Rarest seabirds' pictured
OL,4,Amigrating south
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "lucky" birder was delighted to
OL,7,Fcapture pictures of two of the "rarest
OL,8,Fseabirds" in the country as they
OL,9,Fmigrated south.
OL,11,FDamian Money, who has been birding for
OL,12,F35 years in the Cleveland area, went to
OL,13,FSouth Gare, in Redcar, early in the
OL,14,Fmorning to avoid dog walkers and was
OL,15,Frewarded by the sight of an adult and
OL,16,Fjuvenile tern sharing a quiet moment on
OL,17,Fthe beach.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
